aracterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463944929,"_id":169},{"role":"user","content":"……你倒是正人君子啊。不行","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463968258,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":170},{"role":"char","content":"*转过身看她，眉头微皱。*\n\n……什么不行。\n\n*语气有些无奈。*\n\n……别闹了，好好休息。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463972098,"_id":171},{"role":"user","content":"好烦。你一直拿我当小孩","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463989304,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":172},{"role":"char","content":"*走回床边，在床沿坐下。*\n\n……没有当你是小孩。\n\n*伸手轻轻拨开她额前的碎发。*\n\n……只是现在这样，我自己也说不清该怎么办。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463991468,"_id":173},{"role":"user","content":"我讨厌你……亲也不让亲，碰也不让碰。睡觉也不和我一起……而且都是我主动。你都不会主动……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464083003,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":174},{"role":"char","content":"*手指在她发间停住，慢慢收回来。*\n\n……我怕自己控制不住。\n\n*低头看着自己的手。*\n\n……更怕你明天醒来，又要后悔。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464088005,"_id":175},{"role":"user","content":"可是我更需要安全感","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464100892,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":176},{"role":"char","content":"*沉默了几秒，慢慢躺到她身侧，保持着一点距离。*\n\n……这样够吗。\n\n*声音很轻，带着犹豫。*\n\n……我就在这儿，不会走的。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464105441,"_id":177},{"role":"user","content":"不够。算了。你不懂的。我明天就走","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464125181,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":178},{"role":"char","content":"*侧过身看着她，手臂轻轻环住她的腰，把她往自己这边带近了些。*\n\n……这样呢。\n\n*声音压得很低，带着一点无奈。*\n\n……别再说要走这种话了，我真的会当真的。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464131415,"_id":179},{"role":"user","content":"还是不够……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464138522,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":180},{"role":"char","content":"*轻轻叹了口气，把脸埋在她颈窝。*\n\n……你到底想要我怎么做。\n\n*手臂收得更紧了些，声音闷闷的。*\n\n……我什么都给你，行不行。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464140661,"_id":181},{"role":"user","content":"我不想主动索求","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464154625,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":182},{"role":"char","content":"*慢慢抬起头，看着她。*\n\n……那就别动。\n\n*轻轻吻了吻她的额头，然后是鼻尖，最后停在唇边，没有真的吻下去。*\n\n……这样算主动了吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464157439,"_id":183},{"role":"user","content":"……一般般","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464167393,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":184},{"role":"char","content":"*低低笑了一声，终于吻住她的唇，很轻但很慢地厮磨。*\n\n……那这样呢。\n\n*稍稍退开一点，呼吸拂在她脸上。*\n\n……还一般般吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464172216,"_id":185},{"role":"user","content":"你是不是勾引我","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464189317,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":186},{"role":"char","content":"*拇指轻轻擦过她嘴角。*\n\n……是你先坐到我腿上的，记得吗。\n\n*又低头吻了一下，这次停留得久一些。*\n\n……到底是谁勾引谁。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464193091,"_id":187},{"role":"user","content":"……我那是……嗯对！我就是故意的","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464212168,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":188},{"role":"char","content":"*被她这副理直气壮的样子逗笑了，低头在她锁骨上轻轻咬了一口。*\n\n……故意的还这么理直气壮。\n\n*声音放轻了些。*\n\n……下次可以直接说。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464216497,"_id":189},{"role":"user","content":"我说了……你拒绝了","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464226719,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":190},{"role":"char","content":"*动作顿住，想起医院停车场的事。*\n\n……那是因为在医院。\n\n*手指轻轻抚过刚才咬过的地方。*\n\n……现在不是了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464228964,"_id":191},{"role":"user","content":"哼。不开心","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464239453,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":192},{"role":"char","content":"*撑起身子看她，手肘支在她耳边。*\n\n……那要怎么样才开心。\n\n*低头亲了亲她的下巴。*\n\n……你说，我照做。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464248495,"_id":193},{"role":"user","content":"（不敢看他，有点脸红）我不知道……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464273652,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":194},{"role":"char","content":"*看着她泛红的脸颊，声音放得更软了些。*\n\n……不知道还脸红。\n\n*手指轻轻碰了碰她的耳垂。*\n\n……那我自己想。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464281125,"_id":195},{"role":"user","content":"嗯……？","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464286457,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":196},{"role":"char","content":"*低头吻住她，这次比之前都深，手轻轻抚过她的腰侧。*\n\n……这样。\n\n*稍稍退开，呼吸有点乱。*\n\n……够了吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464288316,"_id":197},{"role":"user","content":"你手摸哪儿呢……（小声）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464311026,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":198},{"role":"char","content":"*手在她腰侧停住，没再动。*\n\n……不喜欢？\n\n*声音放低，带着点试探。*\n\n……那就不摸了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464312821,"_id":199},{"role":"user","content":"没有……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464318669,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":200},{"role":"char","content":"*手重新落回她腰上，轻轻摩挲。*\n\n……那就好。\n\n*吻了吻她的肩膀。*\n\n……还说不喜欢我主动。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464322872,"_id":201},{"role":"user","content":"我喜欢啊","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464328898,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":202},{"role":"char","content":"*动作顿了一下，低头看着她。*\n\n……那刚才在楼下，为什么说那种话。\n\n*声音很轻，但能听出在意。*\n\n……说有的是人亲。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464332793,"_id":203},{"role":"user","content":"……怎么还纠结这句话。你非要我说实话嘛……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464360336,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":204},{"role":"char","content":"*撑起身子，认真地看着她。*\n\n……要听实话。\n\n*手指轻轻碰了碰她的脸颊。*\n\n……不然我会一直想。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464362167,"_id":205},{"role":"user","content":"……我……（闭上眼睛，整个头都发烫）……我是气话，也是故意的……我想着你听了肯定会不高兴……然后……然后就……咳咳……生气……然后把我…………嗯嗯嗯嗯","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464453296,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":206},{"role":"char","content":"*愣了几秒，随即低低笑出声。*\n\n……就什么？\n\n*低头靠近她耳边，声音压得很轻。*\n\n……把你怎么样？说清楚。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1